### ==============================================================================
### DecorAR: Colección de Solicitudes HTTP de API y Patrones (DECOR-26)
### ==============================================================================
### Archivo ejecutable compatible con REST Client (VS Code / JetBrains / Bruno).
### Cubre Catálogo (DECOR-28), Builder (DECOR-27), Prototype (DECOR-24) y Composite (DECOR-25).
### Demuestra respuestas 200/201, 204, 400, 401, 404 y 422 con trazabilidad de correlationId.
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@correlationId = req-decor26-test-trace-uuid
@packageId = aaaaaaaa-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@moduleIdPista = aaaaaaaa-0001-4000-8000-000000000001
@moduleIdMesa = aaaaaaaa-0002-4000-8000-000000000002
@moduleIdArco = aaaaaaaa-0003-4000-8000-000000000003

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. CATÁLOGO DE MÓDULOS (DECOR-28)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Listar módulos activos del catálogo (200 OK - Público, no requiere Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. BUILDER: CREACIÓN Y GESTIÓN DE PAQUETES (DECOR-27)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Crear paquete base para salón social (201 Created)
# @name createPackage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}-create
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

{
  "spaceType": "salonSocial",
  "capacityM2": 50
}

### 2.2 Agregar módulo al paquete (201 Created - Pista de baile 16 m²)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/{{packageId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}-add-item
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

{
  "moduleId": "{{moduleIdPista}}"
}

### 2.3 Quitar módulo del paquete por itemId (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/{{packageId}}/items/dddddddd-0001-4ddd-8ddd-dddddddddddd
Accept: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}-remove-item
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. PROTOTYPE: CLONACIÓN PROFUNDA (DECOR-24)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Clonar paquete con todos sus elementos dependientes (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/{{packageId}}/clone
Accept: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}-clone
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. COMPOSITE: GRUPOS DECORATIVOS (DECOR-25)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Crear grupo compuesto "Zona de bienvenida" con Arco y Mesa (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/{{packageId}}/groups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}-create-group
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

{
  "name": "Zona de bienvenida",
  "children": [
    { "moduleId": "{{moduleIdArco}}" },
    { "moduleId": "{{moduleIdMesa}}" }
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. MANEJO DE ERRORES Y CASOS NEGATIVOS (Actividad.md 8.17 / 8.18)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Cuerpo de solicitud malformado o inválido (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

{
  "spaceType": "invalido",
  "capacityM2": -10
}

### 5.2 Solicitud sin autenticación (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "spaceType": "casa",
  "capacityM2": 30
}

### 5.3 Paquete inexistente o ajeno para evitar enumeración (404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

{
  "moduleId": "{{moduleIdMesa}}"
}

### 5.4 Capacidad de espacio excedida (422 Unprocessable Entity - Regla de Negocio)
# Intento de agregar 32 m² en un espacio residencial con límite de 30 m²
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/{{packageId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: sb-access-token=MOCK_AUTH_COOKIE_USER_A

{
  "moduleId": "{{moduleIdPista}}"
}
